## Objective
- Autonomously hunt for valid, high-impact client-side and server-side vulnerabilities on authorized target `account.ui.com` per `skills/AGENT.md`, testing UI routes/API endpoints one-by-one and documenting evidence under `result/`.

## Important Details
- Repo root: `/home/runner/work/aaii-aautomattionn-for-doomainn/aaii-aautomattionn-for-doomainn`.
- Authorized scope from `data/targets.txt`: `account.ui.com` (domain-only). Must discover UI routes/API endpoints via Chrome MCP, visit each route one-by-one, wait 5–10s for JS, test client-side then server-side, document, then move on; maintain a progress report (total/tested/pending routes).
- Safety rules are binding: no scope expansion to sibling domains "because they are related"; write out-of-scope items to `result/out-of-scope.txt`; if scope ambiguous write `result/BLOCKED.md`.
- **Scope decision/assumption (open):** all app APIs are cross-origin (`sso.ui.com`, `sso.ubnt.com`, `account.svc.ui.com`, `*.svc.ui.com`, `geo.svc.ui.com`, etc.) → per AGENT.md rule #2, do NOT actively test them; document as observed/out-of-scope. Prior session had probed `sso.ui.com` for registration; do not repeat active testing.
- Account creation is blocked: reCAPTCHA Enterprise + CSP (`connect-src` blocks `https://www.google.com/recaptcha/enterprise/clr`); direct `POST https://sso.ui.com/api/sso/v2/users` → `403 {"error_code":"CHALLENGE_RECAPTCHA_TOKEN_REQUIRED"}`; case-variant `SUBMIT` also 403. Proceed unauthenticated only.
- `creds/test-account.txt` is for `console.byteplus.com` — OUT OF SCOPE, do not use.
- Watchdog kills run after ~2 min with no log output (prior `status=124`, attempts=3). Keep tool calls/output frequent; checkpoint files often.
- Chrome DevTools MCP works: pageId 1, Chrome headless at `http://127.0.0.1:9222`; `opencode.json` config uses `npx -y chrome-devtools-mcp@latest --browser-url=http://127.0.0.1:9222`.
- Target hash `ff311b9fcf5fa16d5c8d15bb89a4bb1f1d84e7a625dc0acb53dec02e1accd998`; latest decision=preserved (workflow_dispatch).
- Current date on runner: 2026-10-30 UTC.

