# Out-of-Scope Assets Observed (not actively tested)

Authorization: `data/targets.txt` = `account.ui.com` (domain-only).

AGENT.md Section 2.2: do not move to sibling domains or subdomains "because they
are related". The account.ui.com SPA is a static CloudFront/S3 app whose APIs are
all on other hosts. Active testing of the hosts below was therefore DEFERRED and
NOT performed; they were only observed as normal application traffic or read
from the client JavaScript configuration.

## Observed API / asset hosts (do not actively test)

| Host | Purpose / evidence |
|------|--------------------|
| sso.ui.com | `/api/sso/v1/...`, `/api/sso/v2/users`; login/registration backend; CSP/siteverify observed |
| sso.ubnt.com | `/api/sso/v1/*` login, self, 2FA, roles |
| account.svc.ui.com | Zendesk user/ticket/comment APIs |
| fabric.svc.ui.com | MSP / IdP configuration APIs |
| billing.svc.ui.com | subscriptions, customers, payment methods, invoices |
