| ues.svc.ui.com | site support subscriptions |
| lte-api.svc.ui.com, u5g-api.svc.ui.com, trunking.svc.ui.com | ISP/Talk APIs |
| cloudaccess.svc.ui.com | NCA credentials/backups/devices |
| umr.svc.ui.com, cap.svc.ui.com | UMR / CAP integrations |
