| Third-party: Google Analytics, Sentry (`o21767.ingest.sentry.io`), Stripe (`m.stripe.com`, `js.stripe.com`), TapPay, Ada, Zendesk, SendSafely, Ironclad, reCAPTCHA | third-party services |
| console.byteplus.com | unrelated; credentials in creds/ are NOT used against it |

## Impact of this decision

- Server-side/API testing on the target is effectively blocked by strict scope
  interpretation. The registration endpoint is also on `sso.ui.com`.
- Unauthenticated client-side testing of account.ui.com routes continues.
- Any candidate requiring API mutation is recorded as **Unresolved**, not tested.
